   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_db48a2092e4776fa00bc",
   "sourceHash": "db48a2092e4776fa00bcb353167e2da329816691c54560a5fc134a66256e4f9f",
   "text": "ハーブを用いた点鼻療法で的を絞った浄化を行い、頭部や副鼻腔の不調、片頭痛の緩和を図ります。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ab29e574f08320620859",
   "sourceHash": "ab29e574f08320620859cc588aa8bd5c6d098376ddc080c15fea190b72b9c9ac",
   "text": "ラクタモークシャナ（Raktamokshana）：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_75c5980dba395e478406",
   "sourceHash": "75c5980dba395e478406e14dfff79374ea84a169c1e2fcdd4140e074e869bb25",
   "text": "これらの療法は、皮膚の問題やむくみの原因となる毒素を取り除き、身体を浄化します。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
