   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Kairali Ayurvedic Village — アジア最高のアーユルヴェーダ・リトリート[[CLOSE_1]] [[OPEN_2]]「神の国に広がる地上の楽園」— Pramod Mahajan（Joint Secretary）[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Name 'Kairali Ayurvedic Village' and the title 'Joint Secretary' kept verbatim (no country-specific title invented). 'God's own Country' is Kerala's tourism epithet, rendered 神の国. 'Asia's Best Ayurvedic Retreat' appears to be an accolade; if it is a formal award title it may need to stay in English verbatim."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8c6c8186c4bbbe3804f",
   "sourceHash": "b8c6c8186c4bbbe3804fcc4767b2bd91ccd868ba4a5418fb84472f3ba404783e",
